{"step_index":103,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T18:08:35Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"@'\\n# BhashaSetu AI (भाषासेतु AI)\\n> **\\\"Every Child Learns Best in Their Mother Tongue\\\"**  \\n> **Smart India Hackathon 2024 — Government of Jharkhand Track (Problem Statement #1628)**  \\n> **Theme:** EdTech / Digital India / Inclusive Education\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🌟 Executive Summary\\n**BhashaSetu AI** is an AI-powered, offline-capable translation and vernacular pedagogy tool designed specifically for rural and tribal primary schools in Jharkhand. It bridges the critical language mismatch between state-appointed teachers (who speak Hindi/English) and primary school children (who speak indigenous tribal languages such as Santhali, Mundari, Ho, Kurukh, and Kharia).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Key Features\\n\\n1. **Bilingual UI Switcher**: Complete site UI switches between **English** and **Hindi (हिन्दी)** instantaneously.\\n2. **Offline-First Edge AI (0 kbps)**: Simulated 4-bit quantized IndicTrans2 and Whisper ASR edge models running locally on low-cost tablets with zero internet connectivity.\\n3. **Interactive Working Translator**:\\n   - Live bidirectional translation between Hindi, English, Bengali, Odia, Tamil, Telugu, and Jharkhand's tribal languages (**Santhali in Ol Chiki script**, **Mundari**, **Ho in Warang Chiti**, **Kurukh**, **Kharia**).\\n   - One-click classroom scenario presets (Morning Greeting & Roll Call, Math Addition, Hygiene & Mid-Day Meal, Folk Tale Introduction, Science Observation).\\n   - Microphone voice input simulation with animated soundwave visualizer.\\n   - Realistic multi-stage pipeline loading animation (Acoustic tokenization -> Transformer alignment -> Native synthesis).\\n   - Dual-script output: Native script (e.g. Ol Chiki glyphs) + Devanagari transliteration.\\n   - Teacher's Romanized Phonetic pronunciation guide (empowering non-tribal teachers to speak the mother tongue directly).\\n   - Multimodal contextual educational flashcard aid with relevant emoji pictograms.\\n   - Synthetic speech audio playback and copy to clipboard.\\n4. **How It Works & System Architect\n<truncated 743 bytes>","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Lenovo\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\bhashasetu-ai\"","IsDaemon":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"3000","toolAction":"\"Write README.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Create README.md documentation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
